# The opening cutscene: the longest stretch of the game that needs no
# navigation at all, and the one with the most rendering in it.
name: opening
summary: The Valuan bridge and the boarding, advanced by one A press every 150 frames.
frames: 7500
pad: 1600:start,1640:a,1800:start,1840:a,2000:start,2040:a,2200:start,2240:a
pad: 2400:start,2440:a,2600:start,2640:a,2800:start,2840:a,3000:start,3040:a
pad: 3200:start,3240:a
pad: 3600:a@150
env: SOA_RENDER=1
env: SOA_SNAP=100

shows: ten minutes of scripted story: Alfonso and Galcian on the Valuan
shows:   bridge, the helmsman, Vyse and Aika boarding -- all of it drawn by the
shows:   software GX from the game's own command stream.
shows: dialogue text, which was blank until the texture coordinate scale
shows:   registers were indexed by coordinate rather than by map (FINDINGS
shows:   "Text"). A frame with no glyphs in it is that defect returning.
shows: the searchlight beams around frame 4000 (PLAN C1). They are bright,
shows:   and have been since the texture use-after-free was fixed; what is
shows:   left is that no beam fragment samples a texel alpha below 176, so the
shows:   sprite's fade never appears (FINDINGS).

evidence: build/boot_text.log: 19 scripted events, START/A pairs to 3240 and
evidence:   then A at 3600, 3750, 3900 ... 7350 -- one press every 150 frames,
evidence:   which is the @150 repeat. Snapshots every 100 frames.
evidence: build/boot_wav.log is this script exactly -- 19 events -- over a
evidence:   longer budget with the WAV writer attached. build/boot_text2.log is
evidence:   the same nineteen with eight more events after them that its own
evidence:   button transitions never show: stick deflections, lost the way
evidence:   hold.scn describes. It is not this script, and is here as the run
evidence:   that carried the A repeat out to frame 45000 without trouble.
note: The first nine START/A pairs are the standard preamble: START at 1600
note:   dismisses the title, A at 1640 takes New Game, and the eight pairs that
note:   follow walk the first dialogue boxes. From 3600 one A press every 150
note:   frames advances everything after that. Every saved run in build/ that
note:   got past the title begins with exactly these nineteen events.
